From 09b8eeae734ae1757a26fcd4f0ef4c1afb605999 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 15:58:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] fix(rfork): release compiled model hooks before fallback

Remove TorchDynamo bytecode hooks owned by discarded RFork models before fallback allocation. Snapshot hook IDs before initialization to cover partially constructed models while preserving existing target hooks and unrelated callbacks.

Add regression coverage using the real Dynamo registry and weak references for seed misses, initialization/layout/transfer failures, successful loading, and lazy Dynamo import. Eight regression cases failed before the fix and pass afterward.

Validation: 149 CPU-isolated RFork tests passed; Ruff check/format and git diff checks passed. NPU reproduction and full runtime integration remain pending.
Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
---
